WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
NexTile. Room for every window.

00:02.400 --> 00:08.700
New windows automatically split the largest available tile.

00:08.700 --> 00:13.000
Drag a shared boundary. Both neighboring windows resize together.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.800
Drop a window onto another tile to split its space.

00:16.800 --> 00:20.700
Press Super. The workspace pill expands into search.

00:20.700 --> 00:26.200
Scroll to switch workspaces while keeping your search.

00:26.200 --> 00:32.000
Quick Settings: tiling, gaps, top bar, search and terminal transparency.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.600
NexTile. GNOME 46–51. Eleven languages. Open source.
